sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Assistant as Lab Assistant
  participant CronWorker as Node-Cron Worker (Hourly)
  participant TicketAPI as Ticket API (/api/v1/tickets)
  participant DB as MongoDB (Tickets/Audit/Notif)
  participant SocketIO as Socket.IO Server
  actor Authority as Department Authority

  %% Scenario A: Automated Background SLA Escalation (Hourly Cron BR-5)
  Note over CronWorker, DB: Track A: Automated Background SLA Escalation
  CronWorker->>CronWorker: Scheduled trigger (0 * * * * - every hour)
  CronWorker->>DB: Setting.findOne({ key: 'escalation_timeout_hours' })
  DB-->>CronWorker: Returns threshold (default 24h)
  CronWorker->>DB: Ticket.find({ status: { $in: ['OPEN', 'ASSIGNED'] }, isActive: true, createdAt <= cutoff })
  DB-->>CronWorker: Returns overdue tickets array

  loop For Each Overdue Ticket
    CronWorker->>DB: Update status to ESCALATED, append timeline (actor: SYSTEM)
    CronWorker->>DB: AuditLog.create({ action: 'TICKET_AUTO_ESCALATED' })
    CronWorker->>DB: Notification.create({ type: 'WARNING', title: 'Ticket Auto-Escalated' })
    CronWorker->>SocketIO: emitToLab(labId, 'ticket:escalated', ticket)
    SocketIO-)Authority: Real-time escalation alert
  end

  %% Scenario B: Manual Assistant Escalation / Part Request
  Note over Assistant, Authority: Track B: Manual Assistant Escalation / Part Request
  Assistant->>TicketAPI: PATCH /api/v1/tickets/:id/status { nextStatus: 'ESCALATED', note: 'Hardware bottleneck: RAM replacement needed' }
  TicketAPI->>DB: Verify assistant assigned to lab & transition allowed
  TicketAPI->>DB: Update status to ESCALATED, append timeline
  TicketAPI->>DB: AuditLog.create({ action: 'TICKET_STATUS_UPDATED' })
  TicketAPI->>SocketIO: emitToLab(labId, 'ticket:escalated', ticket)
  TicketAPI-->>Assistant: HTTP 200 OK (Ticket Escalated)

  %% Scenario C: Department Authority Decision
  Note over Authority, DB: Track C: Authority Review & Resolution
  Authority->>TicketAPI: Inspects Escalated Ticket (Dept Scoped)
  alt Authority Resolves / Closes with Verification (BR-8)
    Authority->>TicketAPI: PATCH /api/v1/tickets/:id/status { nextStatus: 'CLOSED', testedOk: true, resolutionNotes: 'Replaced power supply unit and verified benchmark' }
    TicketAPI->>DB: Validate testedOk === true && resolutionNotes non-empty
    TicketAPI->>DB: Updates ticket: status = CLOSED, isActive = false, closedAt = now
    TicketAPI->>DB: AuditLog.create({ action: 'TICKET_STATUS_UPDATED' })
    TicketAPI->>SocketIO: emitToLab(labId, 'ticket:closed', ticket)
    TicketAPI-->>Authority: HTTP 200 OK (Ticket Closed)
  else Authority Reassigns / Returns to Work
    Authority->>TicketAPI: PATCH /api/v1/tickets/:id/status { nextStatus: 'IN_PROGRESS', note: 'External technician scheduled' }
    TicketAPI->>DB: Updates ticket: status = IN_PROGRESS
    TicketAPI-->>Authority: HTTP 200 OK
  end
